WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.811
The Tang Monk introduced himself to the prince and then waved toward the others.

2
00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:08.348
"These are my companions.

3
00:00:08.349 --> 00:00:11.946
We're going to the Western Paradise to get scriptures from Buddha."

4
00:00:11.947 --> 00:00:14.462
[g@"What's going on?" asked the prince.

5
00:00:14.463 --> 00:00:17.332
"Why did the monkey lead me here?"@g]

6
00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:24.424
"The man ruling the Black Rooster Kingdom is not really the king," said the monk.

7
00:00:24.425 --> 00:00:26.948
He told the prince everything.

8
00:00:26.949 --> 00:00:31.463
When the Tang Monk's story was finished, the prince was furious.

9
00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:36.619
"You're lying! I will have you arrested for making up such a story!"

10
00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:39.431
[g@The Tang Monk reached into his robe.

11
00:00:39.432 --> 00:00:42.548
He pulled out the jade coin.@g]

12
00:00:42.549 --> 00:00:45.738
"Your father told me to show you this."

13
00:00:45.739 --> 00:00:47.462
[g@The prince gasped.

14
00:00:47.463 --> 00:00:49.813
"That coin belongs to my father!@g]

15
00:00:49.814 --> 00:00:52.381
[g@It's a royal treasure."

16
00:00:52.382 --> 00:00:56.793
He began to cry.

17
00:00:56.794 --> 00:00:58.815
"Your story must be true.@g]

18
00:00:58.816 --> 00:01:00.859
[g@My poor father.

19
00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:05.416
All this time, people thought that evil Daoist was him."@g]

20
00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:07.977
[g@"Don't worry," said Wukong.

21
00:01:07.978 --> 00:01:12.399
"We'll get rid of that fake king."@g]

22
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:16.024
Late that night Wukong lay awake.

23
00:01:16.025 --> 00:01:19.776
"The Daoist will deny everything," he thought.

24
00:01:19.777 --> 00:01:23.478
"We need proof that he killed the real king."

25
00:01:23.479 --> 00:01:26.373
[g@He poked Bajie, who was fast asleep.

26
00:01:26.374 --> 00:01:28.843
"Bajie, wake up."@g]

27
00:01:28.844 --> 00:01:30.824
[g@The pig rolled over.

28
00:01:30.825 --> 00:01:35.541
"Leave me alone . . . sleeping."@g]

29
00:01:35.542 --> 00:01:38.704
"We need to do something," said Wukong.

30
00:01:38.705 --> 00:01:43.565
"Not now," mumbled Bajie.

31
00:01:43.566 --> 00:01:46.713
"I know where there's treasure," the monkey lied.

32
00:01:46.714 --> 00:01:49.652
[g@Bajie's eyes popped open.

33
00:01:49.653 --> 00:01:51.959
"Where is the treasure?"@g]

34
00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:55.824
"Follow me," said Wukong.

35
00:01:55.825 --> 00:02:00.904
They went outside and flew to the palace.

36
00:02:00.905 --> 00:02:05.869
In a small courtyard, Wukong rushed toward a well.

37
00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:07.736
[g@"The treasure is in this well,"

38
00:02:07.737 --> 00:02:11.155
said the monkey, pulling the lid off.@g]

39
00:02:11.156 --> 00:02:15.456
Bajie peered down into the darkness.

40
00:02:15.457 --> 00:02:18.602
"Is this the well the king was pushed into?"

41
00:02:18.603 --> 00:02:20.065
[g@"Oh, I'm not sure,"

42
00:02:20.066 --> 00:02:22.953
said Wukong, pretending to not know.@g]

43
00:02:22.954 --> 00:02:26.743
"The treasure is definitely down there though."

44
00:02:26.744 --> 00:02:31.034
"How will we get it out?" asked the pig.

45
00:02:31.035 --> 00:02:37.022
Wukong pushed Bajie, and the pig splashed into the water.

46
00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:40.258
"You rotten monkey!" shouted Bajie.

47
00:02:40.259 --> 00:02:42.639
[g@The monkey laughed.

48
00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.703
"Find the treasure, and I'll let you back up."@g]

49
00:02:45.704 --> 00:02:56.746
Angry, Bajie dived down, deeper and deeper, until he arrived at a palace.

50
00:02:56.747 --> 00:02:59.879
[g@"Greetings," said a dragon.

51
00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:04.217
"I'm the Well Dragon King."@g]

52
00:03:04.218 --> 00:03:07.122
[g@"My name is Zhu Bajie," said the pig.

53
00:03:07.123 --> 00:03:09.151
"I'm here for treasure."@g]

54
00:03:09.152 --> 00:03:13.524
"I don't have any treasure for you," said the dragon.

55
00:03:13.525 --> 00:03:16.858
[g@He looked up.

56
00:03:16.859 --> 00:03:19.331
"You came from the well.@g]

57
00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:23.274
Are you from the Black Rooster Kingdom?"

58
00:03:23.275 --> 00:03:25.874
"Not exactly," said Bajie.

59
00:03:25.875 --> 00:03:30.311
"My friends and I are helping the king of the Black Rooster Kingdom."

60
00:03:30.312 --> 00:03:34.382
"Oh, really?" The dragon raised his eyebrows.

61
00:03:34.383 --> 00:03:43.814
"I have something for you. Follow me."

62
00:03:43.815 --> 00:03:49.927
The Well Dragon King led Bajie into a room.

63
00:03:49.928 --> 00:03:51.416
[g@The pig gasped.

64
00:03:51.417 --> 00:03:54.754
The body of a man lay on a table.@g]

65
00:03:54.755 --> 00:03:59.828
"This is the Black Rooster King's body," said the dragon.

66
00:03:59.829 --> 00:04:03.082
"Please take it back with you."

67
00:04:03.083 --> 00:04:08.494
Bajie was furious that Wukong had tricked him.

68
00:04:08.495 --> 00:04:12.589
He lifted the king's body and headed back to the well.

69
00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:18.110
"I will get revenge later," he said to himself.

70
00:04:18.111 --> 00:04:22.286
The next morning the Tang Monk looked at the king's body.

71
00:04:22.287 --> 00:04:25.318
"I wish we could bring him back to life."

72
00:04:25.319 --> 00:04:29.847
"Wukong can bring him back to life," said Bajie suddenly.

73
00:04:29.848 --> 00:04:32.295
"What!" cried the monkey.

74
00:04:32.296 --> 00:04:34.644
The Tang Monk smiled.

75
00:04:34.645 --> 00:04:36.563
[g@"That's wonderful, Wukong.

76
00:04:36.564 --> 00:04:39.589
Please bring him back to life right away."@g]

77
00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:42.754
Bajie giggled.

78
00:04:42.755 --> 00:04:46.292
"I don't know how to do that!" said the monkey.

79
00:04:46.293 --> 00:04:49.847
"Don't believe him, Master," said Bajie.

80
00:04:49.848 --> 00:04:52.082
[g@"He can bring the king back to life.

81
00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:54.618
He just doesn't want to."@g]

82
00:04:54.619 --> 00:04:58.081
"That's not true!" protested Wukong.

83
00:04:58.082 --> 00:05:01.449
[g@"He's lying, Master," said Bajie.

84
00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:10.574
"Use the Tight Headband spell!"@g]

